Boogeyman is a thriller, horror, drama film directed by Stephen Kay.

3
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:27,000
Every culture has one – the horrible monster
fueling young children's nightmares.

4
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
But for Tim, the Boogeyman still lives in his memories as a
creature that devoured his father 16 years ago.

5
